{
  "topic_id": "space-eat-004",
  "channel": "space",
  "program": "sky_life",
  "air_date": "2026-09-28",
  "segments": [
    {
      "kind": "sting",
      "text": "",
      "seconds": 3.0,
      "asset": "mon",
      "voice": null,
      "step": "",
      "emotion": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "announce",
      "text": "大家好,我是陈果!",
      "seconds": null,
      "asset": null,
      "voice": "chenguo",
      "step": "",
      "emotion": "happy"
    },
    {
      "kind": "announce",
      "text": "我是多多!",
      "seconds": null,
      "asset": null,
      "voice": "duoduo",
      "step": "",
      "emotion": "happy"
    },
    {
      "kind": "announce",
      "text": "一周又开始了,天上的日子。今天想问你一件事:宇航员为什么总说,天上的菜没味道?",
      "seconds": null,
      "asset": null,
      "voice": "chenguo",
      "step": "",
      "emotion": "surprised"
    },
    {
      "kind": "vo",
      "text": "宇航员的餐盘里,永远少不了一瓶辣椒酱。",
      "seconds": null,
      "asset": null,
      "voice": "chenguo",
      "step": "",
      "emotion": "happy"
    },
    {
      "kind": "vo",
      "text": "墨西哥味的、路易斯安那味的,一箱一箱地往飞船上搬。",
      "seconds": null,
      "asset": null,
      "voice": "chenguo",
      "step": "",
      "emotion": "happy"
    },
    {
      "kind": "vo",
      "text": "是地面上做的菜不好吃吗?",
      "seconds": null,
      "asset": null,
      "voice": "duoduo",
      "step": "",
      "emotion": "surprised"
    },
    {
      "kind": "vo",
      "text": "不是,地面饭菜明明经过精心调味。",
      "seconds": null,
      "asset": null,
      "voice": "chenguo",
      "step": "",
      "emotion": "happy"
    },
    {
      "kind": "vo",
      "text": "可到了天上,宇航员还是总说菜没味道。",
      "seconds": null,
      "asset": null,
      "voice": "chenguo",
      "step": "",
      "emotion": "surprised"
    },
    {
      "kind": "vo",
      "text": "这个抱怨,从第一批航天员开始,一直没停过。",
      "seconds": null,
      "asset": null,
      "voice": "chenguo",
      "step": "",
      "emotion": "happy"
    },
    {
      "kind": "vo",
      "text": "菜的味道,到底去哪儿了?",
      "seconds": null,
      "asset": null,
      "voice": "duoduo",
      "step": "",
      "emotion": "surprised"
    },
    {
      "kind": "silence",
      "text": "",
      "seconds": 2.0,
      "asset": null,
      "voice": null,
      "step": "",
      "emotion": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "vo",
      "text": "你有没有感冒堵鼻子的经历?那时候吃什么都没味道,好像舌头也一起感冒了。",
      "seconds": null,
      "asset": null,
      "voice": "chenguo",
      "step": "",
      "emotion": "happy"
    },
    {
      "kind": "vo",
      "text": "有!吃什么都跟嚼纸一样!",
      "seconds": null,
      "asset": null,
      "voice": "duoduo",
      "step": "",
      "emotion": "surprised"
    },
    {
      "kind": "vo",
      "text": "其实不是舌头出了问题,是鼻子。",
      "seconds": null,
      "asset": null,
      "voice": "chenguo",
      "step": "",
      "emotion": "happy"
    },
    {
      "kind": "vo",
      "text": "我们尝到的大部分味道,其实是鼻子闻出来的。",
      "seconds": null,
      "asset": null,
      "voice": "chenguo",
      "step": "",
      "emotion": "happy"
    },
    {
      "kind": "vo",
      "text": "舌头只负责咸淡酸甜。",
      "seconds": null,
      "asset": null,
      "voice": "chenguo",
      "step": "",
      "emotion": "happy"
    },
    {
      "kind": "vo",
      "text": "宇航员在天上,鼻子也会感冒,但不是真的生病。",
      "seconds": null,
      "asset": null,
      "voice": "chenguo",
      "step": "",
      "emotion": "surprised"
    },
    {
      "kind": "vo",
      "text": "那是为什么啊?",
      "seconds": null,
      "asset": null,
      "voice": "duoduo",
      "step": "",
      "emotion": "surprised"
    },
    {
      "kind": "vo",
      "text": "飞船里没有重力,身体里的水分不会乖乖往下走,反而涌向头部。",
      "seconds": null,
      "asset": null,
      "voice": "chenguo",
      "step": "",
      "emotion": "happy"
    },
    {
      "kind": "vo",
      "text": "鼻子里的黏膜跟着肿了一圈。",
      "seconds": null,
      "asset": null,
      "voice": "chenguo",
      "step": "",
      "emotion": "happy"
    },
    {
      "kind": "vo",
      "text": "怪不得,鼻子肿了当然闻不到味道!",
      "seconds": null,
      "asset": null,
      "voice": "duoduo",
      "step": "",
      "emotion": "surprised"
    },
    {
      "kind": "vo",
      "text": "所以这道菜其实调味调得挺好,只是鼻子没闻到。",
      "seconds": null,
      "asset": null,
      "voice": "chenguo",
      "step": "",
      "emotion": "happy"
    },
    {
      "kind": "vo",
      "text": "这时候,辣椒酱就成了救星。",
      "seconds": null,
      "asset": null,
      "voice": "chenguo",
      "step": "",
      "emotion": "happy"
    },
    {
      "kind": "vo",
      "text": "辣椒里的那股辣,其实不是一种味道,更像是一种轻微的疼痛感。",
      "seconds": null,
      "asset": null,
      "voice": "chenguo",
      "step": "",
      "emotion": "surprised"
    },
    {
      "kind": "vo",
      "text": "不用经过鼻子,舌头和嘴巴自己就能感觉到。",
      "seconds": null,
      "asset": null,
      "voice": "chenguo",
      "step": "",
      "emotion": "happy"
    },
    {
      "kind": "vo",
      "text": "不信你现在捏住鼻子,尝一口水试试。",
      "seconds": null,
      "asset": null,
      "voice": "duoduo",
      "step": "",
      "emotion": "happy"
    },
    {
      "kind": "vo",
      "text": "是不是突然没味道了?",
      "seconds": null,
      "asset": null,
      "voice": "duoduo",
      "step": "",
      "emotion": "surprised"
    },
    {
      "kind": "vo",
      "text": "可要是换成辣椒水,鼻子堵成什么样都挡不住。",
      "seconds": null,
      "asset": null,
      "voice": "chenguo",
      "step": "",
      "emotion": "happy"
    },
    {
      "kind": "flip",
      "text": "你以为怪的是食堂难吃。其实怪的是——不是厨师的问题,是鼻子被糊住了!",
      "seconds": null,
      "asset": null,
      "voice": "chenguo",
      "step": "",
      "emotion": "surprised"
    },
    {
      "kind": "retell",
      "text": "在天上鼻子会像感冒一样闻不出味道。所以宇航员都爱带辣椒酱上天。",
      "seconds": null,
      "asset": null,
      "voice": "chenguo",
      "step": "",
      "emotion": "happy"
    },
    {
      "kind": "vo",
      "text": "好啦,今天就聊到这儿。",
      "seconds": null,
      "asset": null,
      "voice": "chenguo",
      "step": "",
      "emotion": "happy"
    },
    {
      "kind": "vo",
      "text": "下次感冒记得试试辣的,说不定管用!",
      "seconds": null,
      "asset": null,
      "voice": "duoduo",
      "step": "",
      "emotion": "happy"
    },
    {
      "kind": "preview",
      "text": "明天,我们看看哈勃望远镜。",
      "seconds": null,
      "asset": null,
      "voice": "chenguo",
      "step": "",
      "emotion": "happy"
    },
    {
      "kind": "preview",
      "text": "为什么它会近视?我们明天见!",
      "seconds": null,
      "asset": null,
      "voice": "duoduo",
      "step": "",
      "emotion": "happy"
    }
  ],
  "waived_rules": []
}